{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_title", "source_sha256": "6cbe85ddd16c70d3106a7e529c0b7675757c64687fb5ed36e45e384789e325c0", "ja": "夢の黎明", "zh": "梦的黎明", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_synopsis", "source_sha256": "630fd51979bd56ef877524df86d4db9a65320674631cd6089a212ec35d84a600", "ja": "新曲をもらった事を、喜んで父親に報告する\n静香。だが成果とは認められず、「アイドル\nは中学生まで」と念を押される。焦る静香\nだったが、プロデューサーと仲間達の支えを\n受け、自身の夢に向かって再び走り出す。", "zh": "静香开心地向父亲报告自己拿到了新歌。\n然而父亲却不认可这是成果，并叮嘱她\n“偶像只能当到初中为止”。感到焦急的\n静香在制作人与同伴们的支持下，\n重新奔向了自己的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1000_p", "source_sha256": "98a6c2bd3b142493c7e8ae5562fa77614884d8c7013f917e2c8cccfececae0ca", "ja": "（静香の新曲を披露したステージが終わった。\n夢をうたう静香の声が、真っ直ぐに突き刺さる……）", "zh": "（演唱静香新曲的舞台结束了。\n静香那唱着梦想的歌声，笔直地刺入人心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "2ec212e5158ed60f849db1c2fad08742c3636aa90dff1f07e28653802cbf54a1", "ja": "みなさん！　私の新曲、\n聴いてくださってありがとうございました！", "zh": "大家！谢谢你们来听我的新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "2f0683ccaac7c55e47580117baee4fb8226967644b3ee31449a0feef446afd4e", "ja": "私は夢を追いかけているところです。だから……\nだから、この歌が大好きです。歌えてよかった……。", "zh": "我正在追逐梦想。所以……\n所以，我最喜欢这首歌了。能唱这首歌真是太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "9f90af43f5590068e9ca863f8672cc2c278fe6d66d7b23a9c5395408cc29b39d", "ja": "そして今日、またひとつ夢に近づくことができました！\n……みなさん本当に、本当にありがとうございました！", "zh": "而今天，我又朝梦想更近了一步！\n……真的、真的非常感谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1004_null", "source_sha256": "0ec5ca83913fd8367a28e55be9059cb97386c0ce7af5533e1805a6c1cf8a90ca", "ja": "ワアアアアアアッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d27df260ce59535c0834739a0d76e92437dba1d00eb61735ae12520d3df1bf94", "ja": "お疲れさま、静香！", "zh": "辛苦了，静香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "cdbba5f0bdca6a19249ab6dd60bdda29d26fab8aec6c5b1ad8085310cd093038", "ja": "{$P$}……！\nあの、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}……！\n那个，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bb8ee81ab06e75b5ddef2e14ae3f5d279188ad05b6e8188cfc5a452d84257288", "ja": "それはもちろん……\n静香が、一番よくわかってるんじゃないか？", "zh": "那当然是……\n静香应该最清楚了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "0face53a1da402e423beea11c59219b5e022b3105bbd03f20937a1fe43ed2e09", "ja": "そ、そうですけど！\n今日はそれだけじゃなくて、その……。", "zh": "是、是这样没错！\n但今天不只是因为这个，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "42e2f4a023a853d42228b56cbf95d8f34969dbe09d957c37d1147377d83f49db", "ja": "{$P$}の口から、\n聞きたいんです！", "zh": "我想亲耳听\n{$P$}你说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1010_p", "source_sha256": "be5b2363566b99a389bd6643ed49e4fcde0758df87fe685d9196ef9f6471f266", "ja": "うん。すごくいいステージだった。\n最高だったよ！", "zh": "嗯。真是一场精彩的演出。\n太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "0e5d71b52818b3ec39a9cc2215e623e33b17fcff543a08703d0e61c279e3c164", "ja": "あ……ありがとう、ございます……。\nよかった……。", "zh": "啊……谢谢……。\n太好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "d3a1416f7035b7f1ed5c7b7c084beb7760f1133dc5b2be0cc40762b55524226d", "ja": "静香ちゃーん！　すごかったよ～！", "zh": "静香——！刚才太厉害了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "3fbee0ffc5b9a518d0c9d687eed724180fa45f91afd3150cc55eb4a8975b7585", "ja": "ああ、いいステージだったな！\nあたしもシビれたよ！", "zh": "啊，真是场精彩的演出啊！\n我也被震撼到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "e22033c04c11d030504b484a5faf83456c7e73bb73ad3678820b39c799ed5d27", "ja": "わたし、とっても感動して……あの、うまく言えないん\nですけど。わたし、静香さんの歌、大好きですっ！", "zh": "我真的非常感动……那个，虽然我说不太好。\n但我真的好喜欢静香小姐的歌声！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0464cb2ed49ea887dad53927fca76ec7813fc1b80f4d283b487d1c087e90c705", "ja": "最上さんの、力強くまっすぐな歌声……\n私の胸にも、響きました。……きっと、大丈夫です。", "zh": "最上小姐那充满力量、直击人心的歌声……\n也深深地回响在我的心中。……一定没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "1a74c6198cec9c0b787d29f2081aa85c9886c50cc7e9b4b71c0813a51cdb3c4f", "ja": "未来……ジュリアさん、星梨花、紬さん。\n本当に、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "未来……茱莉亚、星梨花、紬。真的非常感谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "3ef18aa65be6437b94be5f63c66f2988f77c88b067bcc39557666767245b020c", "ja": "それから、レッスン中はいろいろと\n心配をかけてしまって……本当にごめんなさい。", "zh": "还有，练习的时候让你们操了不少心……真的很对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "694a0a9549edcea82b07bc6190f7a033914bd44f375c026d775fdeaa80d03a76", "ja": "ううん、迷惑なんて全然かけられてないよ！　それに\n今日は静香ちゃんの歌で、いっぱい元気になれたし♪", "zh": "没有啦，完全没有添麻烦哦！而且\n听了静香的歌，今天我也变得精神满满呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "a2529dc07b0b3522c2e8d923842caaa19f65432330fc220ad7a24245b9b80f78", "ja": "はいっ！　わたしも、静香さんに置いていかれ\nないように、がんばらなくちゃって思いました！", "zh": "好的！我也觉得，不能被静香小姐落下，得努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "0fc57e87c836936a2d9aa60e4b43b0689f5a991835bad10e9d50eed9e41cd4c3", "ja": "はは、そうだな。あたしも、シズには\n負けてられないって思ったしな。", "zh": "哈哈，说得没错。我也觉得不能输给静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4194cd59c3576a94e4b7ac080ac18fc3edea31ec014ad265ee2ac870bec08523", "ja": "ええ、そうですね。最上さんの歌の力……\n素晴らしいものだと、改めて感じ入りました。", "zh": "是的，没错。我再次深切感受到，最上小姐歌声的力量……真是非同凡响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "eea00be0f1a297fb80095620fffbe638fc57be846c974c7cdb08d088b01e06f0", "ja": "み、みんな……。あの、\nなんだかちょっと、褒めすぎなんじゃ……。", "zh": "大、大家……那个，是不是有点夸过头了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3e2849f73779afbf36bacb1e50ad1030c5e08237e346515005d6d66a9db9de21", "ja": "そうか？　せっかく褒められてるんだから、\n素直に受け取っておいた方がいいと思うけど。", "zh": "这样吗？难得被夸了，我觉得还是坦率地接受比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "2623ce23cec83b3b34e04f669681c2ed1ff18c7cee95bbf0f6df657586fe59f1", "ja": "{$P$}……うぅ……。", "zh": "{$P$}……呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "7894e74b26fac02ec40d97a9b7723a6afb77e578ee0238407ad861cacd48ef9a", "ja": "公演がもう終わりなんて寂しいな～。\n静香ちゃんの歌、もっと聞きたかったのに～！", "zh": "演出就要结束了，真舍不得啊～。\n明明还想多听听静香的歌呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "18cd17f92b91c7e81b35f2171d22b7ce529a07eea0573f47ac7e5d429086a811", "ja": "あっ、でもこの後は打ち上げですよね！\nみんなでご飯も、楽しみだな～！", "zh": "啊，不过接下来不是还有庆功宴嘛！\n和大家一起吃饭，也很期待呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c6962728137fb7b1b866c43038404fc3aa2aa6681a5d60681dc715c502cc7335", "ja": "そうだな。\nみんな、早く着替えてくるといい。", "zh": "是啊。大家快去换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "71e5f91806cccc8746871a1e5b7c232b8c5334467a0c4cf2ac455bc396479431", "ja": "そうだな、着替えてくるか。\nじゃあ{$P$}、またあとでな♪", "zh": "是啊，去换身衣服吧。\n那么，{$P$}，待会儿见♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "816e526e54e2a27cbb0fd2f6cafbdcca1e3a8da3c20a8ee96367c19c3169b7db", "ja": "私も、失礼します。\n箱崎さん、行きましょうか。", "zh": "我也先告辞了。箱崎，我们走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "223fd713010cb5f2c7db1dd52ce80cf3c208a1485a438f0bf0f95f3c03d39900", "ja": "はいっ！　静香さん、\nあとでたくさんお話聞かせてくださいね♪", "zh": "好！静香小姐，之后请多给我讲讲哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1032_p", "source_sha256": "bea37263fe367d3645a54991011c533d749e1519401049151f49cc77a352be78", "ja": "静香、みんなと一緒に行かないのか？", "zh": "静香，你不和大家一起走吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "4b2e70489e4102511411c661e351eabf30cf0e5698ba2566c0c65b827ace59f7", "ja": "あ、あの。その前に、{$P$}に\n言っておきたいことがあって……。", "zh": "啊，那个。在那之前，我有件事想对{$P$}说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "53b5c373ec1609423e47d9f05c266ecf2fc8f93ae1e7f873d571ecc97440e97e", "ja": "私、やっぱり歌うことが好きです。今日のステージで、\nこれからもアイドルとして歌いたいって思いました。", "zh": "我果然还是喜欢唱歌。今天的舞台让我觉得，今后也想作为偶像继续唱下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "5ed3f3e6e54d12ade37535b577122f810dc83aaf4a379f98e4375c6500dcd1a3", "ja": "だから……これからも私をプロデュースしてください！\nよろしくお願いします、{$P$}！", "zh": "所以……今后也请继续制作我吧！\n今后请多多关照，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1036_p", "source_sha256": "38df758da334cbb71b6088ecd69bf271e081848f622937e3a211587c27d17310", "ja": "静香……ああ、もちろんだ！\nこれから何回だって、ステージに立とうな！", "zh": "静香……啊，当然！今后不管多少次，我们都一起站上舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "5d529226da58e3cb69bb4e2dc8b99120e08a5e83cae483930746630e3fc83a84", "ja": "はいっ！　……失礼します！", "zh": "好的！……我先告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1038_p", "source_sha256": "f5de05195788a369d5b6537d700f9bf4d345b70374e752bb43dcb701772e31cf", "ja": "（静香は衣装を翻して、駆け去っていく。\nステージで楽しそうに歌う、その笑顔を思い出す）", "zh": "（静香翻起裙摆，跑远了。我想起了她在舞台上开心歌唱时的笑容。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_067_1039_p", "source_sha256": "e351359b33169578cdd8a79c678abd24fc236a265fb45b4836b5b132f12f19db", "ja": "（静香も客席も、笑顔で溢れていた……\n絶対に、取り上げさせたりするもんか！）", "zh": "（静香和观众席都洋溢着笑容……我绝不会让任何人把这一切夺走！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
